---
// Quiz figure for go-first-program-modules-packages set 01: two modules side by side and the import line that crosses between them.
// It shows folders, go.mod lines and the import path; it does not say whether the build succeeds.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq01mt">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 270" role="img" aria-label="Two Go modules side by side. The module example.com/greeter holds go.mod, cmd/greeter/main.go and internal/greet/greet.go. The module example.com/other holds go.mod with a replace line and main.go, which imports example.com/greeter/internal/greet.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq01mt-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two modules and one import between them</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai module và một dòng import giữa chúng</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="10" y="36" width="270" height="170" rx="8" class="qfig-gq01mt-card" />
    <text x="24" y="60" class="qfig-gq01mt-t">module example.com/greeter</text>
    <text x="24" y="86" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">go.mod</text>
    <text x="24" y="110" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">cmd/greeter/main.go</text>
    <text x="24" y="134" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">internal/</text>
    <rect x="34" y="144" width="230" height="52" rx="6" class="qfig-gq01mt-hl" />
    <text x="46" y="166" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">greet/greet.go</text>
    <text x="46" y="186" class="qfig-gq01mt-m">package greet; func Hello</text>

    <rect x="300" y="36" width="270" height="170" rx="8" class="qfig-gq01mt-card" />
    <text x="314" y="60" class="qfig-gq01mt-t">module example.com/other</text>
    <text x="314" y="86" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">go.mod</text>
    <text x="324" y="106" class="qfig-gq01mt-m">replace example.com/greeter =&gt; ../greeter</text>
    <text x="314" y="134" class="qfig-gq01mt-c">main.go</text>
    <text x="324" y="154" class="qfig-gq01mt-m">import ".../greeter/internal/greet"</text>

    <path d="M 300 150 L 272 168" class="qfig-gq01mt-arrow" />
    <polygon points="264,172 278,170 272,160" class="qfig-gq01mt-head" />

    <rect x="10" y="222" width="560" height="38" rx="8" class="qfig-gq01mt-card" />
    <text x="24" y="246" class="qfig-gq01mt-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Arrow: the import line in other/main.go names the package in greeter.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mũi tên: dòng import trong other/main.go gọi tên package nằm trong greeter.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq01mt { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq01mt svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq01mt text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq01mt .qfig-gq01mt-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01mt .qfig-gq01mt-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01mt .qfig-gq01mt-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq01mt .qfig-gq01mt-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq01mt .qfig-gq01mt-b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq01mt-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .qfig-gq01mt-hl { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq01mt-arrow { stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-gq01mt-head { fill: var(--act-3); }
</style>
